      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Don't get me wrong, the entire BOTW map in VR sounds awesome, but there's nothing you can do to reduce that size? There's some absolutely insane huge VRC worlds that fit under 500mb, I'd argue with some mesh and texture compression you could manage it (or at least get closer).\n\nhttps://github.com/oneVR/VRWorldToolkit\n\nThe \"Build Debugger\" function in this toolkit should help a lot, giving an itemized list of assets sorted by filesize.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
