      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you Build & Test your world you will be able to see the build world size in your local user folder. AppData\\Local\\Low\\VRChat\\vrchat\\worlds\n\nIt would be nice to see the build size in the console though, and also have documentation of this upload limit for PC.",
